     </draw:frame>tability.</text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="P520">The solution is to enter values for <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#__RefHeading___Toc22881_7842323221" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link">SWL</text:a> and <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#__RefHeading___Toc27248_784232322" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Visited_20_Internet_20_Link">SWCR</text:a>, such that there is a small difference between them, around 2% to 5% for example, instead of this: <text:s text:c="2"/></text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="_40_Example">-- <text:s text:c="69"/></text:p>
    <text:p text:style-name="_40_Example">-- <text:s text:c="6"/>WATER RELATIVE PERMEABILITY TABLES (SWFN) <text:s text:c="21"/></text:p>
